usage: probe_molmo_grounded_planner.py [-h] --request REQUEST
                                       --task-descriptor TASK_DESCRIPTOR
                                       --output OUTPUT
                                       [--mode {dry-run,replay,native}]
                                       [--profile-id PROFILE_ID]
                                       [--model-store MODEL_STORE]
                                       [--model-directory MODEL_DIRECTORY]
                                       [--asset-manifest ASSET_MANIFEST]
                                       [--replay-points REPLAY_POINTS]
                                       [--replay-cloud REPLAY_CLOUD]
                                       [--generation-limit GENERATION_LIMIT]
                                       [--gpu-lock GPU_LOCK] [--capture-fresh]
                                       [--allow-paid]

显式诊断 Molmo/OpenCV/云规划组合；默认空运行，始终禁止硬件派发。

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --request REQUEST
  --task-descriptor TASK_DESCRIPTOR
  --output OUTPUT
  --mode {dry-run,replay,native}
  --profile-id PROFILE_ID
  --model-store MODEL_STORE
  --model-directory MODEL_DIRECTORY
  --asset-manifest ASSET_MANIFEST
  --replay-points REPLAY_POINTS
  --replay-cloud REPLAY_CLOUD
  --generation-limit GENERATION_LIMIT
  --gpu-lock GPU_LOCK
  --capture-fresh
  --allow-paid
